Cell["\<\
On a small closed surface the neighbourhoods of an edge can meet around the \
surface. The Klein quartic is a quotient of the tiling by seven triangles at \
each vertex, but its curvature is 1/7, while on the tiling it is \[Minus]2/7.\
\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"f4c7adb7-a2b3-4fd7-9b35-44659f57b881"],

